      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَاوِيلُ الأَرْضِ</span></b>  means <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْ تُخْطِئَ حَوْلًا وَتُصِيبَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوْلًا</span>, (O, K,) i. e. <i>The leaving the land unsown
one year, and sowing it another year:</i> whereby
the land is strengthened. (TK.)

